   "text": "A quick tour of the table before anything tries to eat you. Along the top are two groups, play tools, and panels and settings. Hover any button for a tooltip. Tools take turns. Picking one turns the last one off. Press move or click the active tool again to turn it off. The map is shared. What you change, everyone sees. What you see through the fog is yours. The party at the bottom has a row for every character. The party, the DMs, and any NPCs you can see. Cards shows every card at once. Roster goes back to rows. Hide Party folds it down. The bar also holds World and props when your DM allows it.",
